            "url": "https://github.com/npm/statusboard/issues/1073",
            "title": "Make pack --json return an object like publish --json instead of an array",
            "date_modified": "2026-02-24T21:06:26.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-02-24T21:06:26.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "wraithgar",
