        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36607?u=79d8c114db476a7ecc6328b328f71d9d758368c7&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">They have been swapped to stderr for json mode, but I think they should always be on stderr. I think an open question would be if they should be called with <code class=\"notranslate\">output.error</code> or as an actual log (maybe with a custom <code class=\"notranslate\">META</code> prefix)? <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"910070198\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/npm/cli/issues/3354\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/npm/cli/issues/3354/hovercard?comment_id=2108901091&amp;comment_type=issue_comment\" href=\"https://github.com/npm/cli/issues/3354#issuecomment-2108901091\">npm/cli#3354 (comment)</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/npm/statusboard/issues/1072",
            "title": "make `run-script` banners a log event",
            "date_modified": "2026-02-24T21:05:49.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-02-24T21:05:26.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "wraithgar",
